<title>MEXICO: Mexico's TIIE 28-day rate falls to 30.1650 pct.</title>
<headline>Mexico's TIIE 28-day rate falls to 30.1650 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's 28-day interbank interest rate (TIIE) fell by 76.50 basis points to 30.1650 percent on Wednesday, from 30.9300 percent on Tuesday, Banco de Mexico said.</p>
<p>THE TIIP rose 32.06 basis points to 30.1400 percent on Wednesday from 29.8194 percent the week before.</p>
<p>The TIIE is a market-weighted average interbank rate that is replacing the TIIP, an average interbank rate.</p>
<p>((-- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9558))</p>
</text>
